multi:
type: txt
help: Custom domain to block (matches the domain and its subdomains)
syntax:expression: pattern $VAR(@) "^[*]?[.]?([A-Za-z0-9]([A-Za-z0-9-]*[A-Za-z0-9])?[.])*[A-Za-z0-9]([A-Za-z0-9-]*[A-Za-z0-9])?$" ; "must be a domain (e.g. example.com or .example.com)"
val_help: txt; Domain to block (example.com blocks www.example.com too)
